{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-04/1063436/block/singleImage/3265358/df/01KQ3SGW5RDQG524F86K3J2SAX.jpg?updatedAt=1794469948\"/><figcaption>九龍城警署。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>九龍城銀行職員懷疑收到偽鈔。 今日（12日）上午10時53分，一名60歲姓林女子到九龍城福佬村道18號滙豐銀行存款，惟其中5張面值100元的澳元（折合約港幣2,681元）懷疑為偽鈔，於是報警。警方接報後到場，該名女子聲稱該批澳元為利是錢。警方已檢走相關鈔票作進一步檢驗，案件仍在調查中。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:43:57.507710+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T07:52:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:57:13.016050+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:37:21.296462+00:00","content_hash":"a39ba18fabc860ab6954bbd67ba477eb3eeb35a5f604dd37ce6551571e50e230","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:43:57.507710+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}